<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Gumball & Friends Streetwear | Özel Baskı T-Shirtler</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2563eb;
            --primary-dark: #1d4ed8;
            --accent: #f59e0b;
            --bg-light: #f8fafc;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-dark: #0f172a;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
            --radius: 16px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .navbar {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .cart-btn {
            background: var(--text-dark);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
        }

        .cart-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .hero {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .hero-text {
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
            color: #60a5fa;
            border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
        }

        .cta-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 4rem 0 2rem;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .products-grid {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto 4rem;
            padding: 0 2rem;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .product-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .product-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .image-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 320px;
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .image-container img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .img-front {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .img-back {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            opacity: 0;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .product-card:hover .img-back {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: scale(1.03);
        }

        .product-card:hover .img-front {
            opacity: 0;
        }

        .badge-back {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            right: 12px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            color: white;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            z-index: 3;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .product-info {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        .product-category {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .product-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .product-description {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .product-bottom {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .add-cart-btn {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            border: none;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .add-cart-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
        }

        footer {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            }
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <nav class="navbar">
            <a href="#" class="logo">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shirt"></i> PRINT<span>WEAR</span>
            </a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#">Ana Sayfa</a></li>
                <li><a href="#urunler">T-Shirtler</a></li>
                <li><a href="#ozel-baski">Arka Baskılılar</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">İletişim</a></li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="cart-btn">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i> Sepet (0)
            </a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <span class="hero-badge">✨ Yeni Sezon Koleksiyonu</span>
            <h1>Sırtında Tarzını Taşı! Gumball, Tavşan & Ayıcık Baskıları</h1>
            <p>Önü sade, arkası efsane tasarımlı %100 pamuklu oversize t-shirtler şimdi yayında.</p>
            <a href="#urunler" class="cta-btn">Koleksiyonu Keşfet <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="urunler">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>Özel Arka Baskılı T-Shirtler</h2>
            <p>Resmin üzerine gelerek tişörtün arkasındaki baskıyı görebilirsin!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="products-grid">

            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="image-container">
                    <span class="badge-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Arkasını Gör</span>
                    <img class="img-front" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521572267360-ee0c2909d518?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="T-Shirt Ön">
                    <img class="img-back" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503342217505-b0a15ec3261c?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="T-Shirt Arka Gumball">
                </div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <div class="product-category">Oversize T-Shirt</div>
                    <h3 class="product-title">Gumball & Darwin Arka Baskılı T-Shirt</h3>
                    <p class="product-description">Siyah %100 pamuk, sırtında HD kalitede Gumball karakter baskısı.</p>
                    <div class="product-bottom">
                        <span class="price">499,90 TL</span>
                        <button class="add-cart-btn">Sepete Ekle</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="image-container">
                    <span class="badge-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Arkasını Gör</span>
                    <img class="img-front" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583743814966-8936f5b7be1a?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="T-Shirt Ön">
                    <img class="img-back" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576995853123-5a10305d93c0?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="T-Shirt Arka Tavşan">
                </div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <div class="product-category">Streetwear</div>
                    <h3 class="product-title">Anime Tavşan (Bunny) Arka Baskılı T-Shirt</h3>
                    <p class="product-description">Krem renkli rahat kesim, sırt detaylı özel grafik çizim.</p>
                    <div class="product-bottom">
                        <span class="price">449,90 TL</span>
                        <button class="add-cart-btn">Sepete Ekle</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="image-container">
                    <span class="badge-back"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Arkasını Gör</span>
                    <img class="img-front" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618354691373-d851c5c3a990?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="T-Shirt Ön">
                    <img class="img-back" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562157873-818bc0726f68?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="T-Shirt Arka Ayıcık">
                </div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <div class="product-category">Premium Koleksiyon</div>
                    <h3 class="product-title">Teddy Bear (Ayıcık) Arka Baskılı T-Shirt</h3>
                    <p class="product-description">Beyaz unisex kesim, sırt bölgesinde sevimli ayıcık nakış/baskı.</p>
                    <div class="product-bottom">
                        <span class="price">479,90 TL</span>
                        <button class="add-cart-btn">Sepete Ekle</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 PrintWear Clothing. Tüm hakları saklıdır. GitHub Pages ile yayınlanmıştır.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
